WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:17,890
Jade nutritionist, please leave your contact information and have a look at my nutritious meal, baby

2
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:18,890
What's wrong with the baby?

3
00:00:18,890 --> 00:00:28,040
Doesn’t the baby like that person? Uncle Zhou

4
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:30,640
Ok, uncle, I will take you away, Mr. Yun.

5
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,640
I am Yuran

6
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:32,840
I'm here to apologize

7
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:34,640
I seem to have frightened the child in your arms

8
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:36,840
This stack of yam rice cakes is very suitable for him to eat

9
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:42,680
Less oil and less salt is good for children

10
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:44,480
I just don’t like to talk very much and I’m very indifferent.

11
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:46,280
So the kids are afraid of me Rainbow Dash

12
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:47,680
Uncle is not a bad person

13
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:54,780
Doesn't the baby like that uncle?

14
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:59,000
Many babies are afraid of babies

15
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:01,200
Don’t eat food from strangers next time, you know?

16
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:03,260
A stranger is someone the baby doesn’t know

17
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:04,660
Baby won't eat

18
00:01:04,660 --> 00:01:05,860
Eat with mouth

19
00:01:05,860 --> 00:01:08,060
Baby's mouth does not evolve into a bowl
